<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">IMPORT · STEP 2 OF 3</span><h1>Match your columns</h1><p>We found <%= @rows.size %> rows. Tell us where to find each detail.</p></div></div>
<% if @import_info["format"] == "horizon_master_fees" %><div class="flash notice">Horizon master-fees export detected. All official names, positions, and fees are matched automatically. <%= @import_info["skipped_meetings"] %> meeting entries are excluded. Fees do not establish that an official has been paid.</div><% end %>
<%= form_with url: preview_games_path do |f| %><section class="card"><div class="form-grid"><% GameImport::FIELDS.each do |field| %><div><%= label_tag "mapping_#{field}", "#{field == 'fees' ? 'Amount paid per row' : field.humanize}#{GameImport::REQUIRED.include?(field) ? ' *' : ' (optional)'}" %><%= select_tag "mapping[#{field}]", options_for_select([["Skip this field", ""]] + @headers.map { |h| [h,h] }, @mapping[field]), id: "mapping_#{field}", required: GameImport::REQUIRED.include?(field) %></div><% end %><div><%= f.label :date_format, "Date format for non-ISO dates" %><%= f.select :date_format, [["Month / Day / Year (10/25/2026)", "%m/%d/%Y"], ["Day / Month / Year (25/10/2026)", "%d/%m/%Y"], ["Year-Month-Day (2026-10-25)", "%Y-%m-%d"]] %></div></div><p class="hint">For one row per official, fees are summed by game number. For one row per game, map the game's total fee. Avoid mapping a repeated game total on every official's row. Unmapped columns remain available in Source details.</p>
<details><summary>My export has separate columns for each officiating position</summary><p class="hint">Match each name column and its fee column. Leave the single Officials field empty. If Amount paid per row is mapped above, it supplies the game total; otherwise the position fees are summed.</p><% [8, @mapping.fetch("official_columns", {}).size].max.times do |index| %><% assignment = @mapping.fetch("official_columns", {})[index.to_s] || {} %><div class="form-grid"><div><%= label_tag "official_name_#{index}", "Official #{index + 1} name column" %><%= select_tag "mapping[official_columns][#{index}][name]", options_for_select([["Skip", ""]] + @headers.map { |h| [h,h] }, assignment["name"]), id: "official_name_#{index}" %></div><div><%= label_tag "official_amount_#{index}", "Official #{index + 1} fee column" %><%= select_tag "mapping[official_columns][#{index}][amount]", options_for_select([["Skip", ""]] + @headers.map { |h| [h,h] }, assignment["amount"]), id: "official_amount_#{index}" %></div><div><%= label_tag "official_position_#{index}", "Official #{index + 1} position column" %><%= select_tag "mapping[official_columns][#{index}][position]", options_for_select([["Skip", ""]] + @headers.map { |h| [h,h] }, assignment["position"]), id: "official_position_#{index}" %></div></div><% end %></details></section><section class="card table-card"><div class="table-heading"><h2>A peek at your file</h2></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><% @headers.each do |h| %><th><%= h %></th><% end %></tr></thead><tbody><% @rows.first(5).each do |row| %><tr><% row.each do |v| %><td><%= v %></td><% end %></tr><% end %></tbody></table></div></section><div class="form-actions"><%= link_to "Start over", new_game_path, class: "button" %><%= f.submit "Review import →", class: "button primary" %></div><% end %>
